---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact - Mike Battle">
  <div class="screenplay plain">
    <h1 class="page-title">Contact</h1>

    <div class="contact-block">
      <div class="label">Email</div>
      <div class="value"><a href="mailto:mikefbattle@gmail.com">mikefbattle@gmail.com</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-block">
      <div class="label">Twitter / X</div>
      <div class="value"><a href="https://twitter.com/mikefbattle" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@mikefbattle</a></div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider" />

    <h2 class="section-title">Behind the Door</h2>
    <p>To be a good writer, you've got to get out and live an interesting life.</p>
    <p>If you're part of, or know of, a world most people never get to see, be that your job, community, or unique obsession - I'd love to hear what's going on behind the door.</p>
    <p>Better still, take me along.</p>

    <div class="contact-block">
      <div class="label">Email</div>
      <div class="value"><a href="mailto:mikefbattle@gmail.com?subject=Behind%20the%20door">mikefbattle@gmail.com</a> — subject line: Behind the door</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
